# <%= current_page.data.title %>

We have a shared library of reusable GitHub Actions workflows, most commonly used for building and pushing Docker images.

This page is a placeholder. Detailed documentation of the available workflows, including the Docker build-and-push workflow, is tracked as a follow-up piece of work.

In the meantime, see the [hmcts/.github](https://github.com/hmcts/.github) repository, or ask in [#platops-help](https://hmcts-reform.slack.com/app_redirect?channel=platops-help).
